            "Connect the family to resources: mental health services, parenting programs, school supports, economic assistance.",
            "Use trauma-informed approaches: explain procedures, offer choices, maintain privacy, avoid re-traumatizing.",
            "Document objectively and coordinate with the interprofessional team."
